인","x":1409,"y":1548,"width":66,"height":36}]},{"text":"응답을 하게 한다. 선택적 재전송과 결합되었을 경우(이미 수신자가 선택적 확인응답","words":[{"text":"응답을","x":178,"y":1606,"width":99,"height":37},{"text":"하게","x":293,"y":1608,"width":63,"height":37},{"text":"한다.","x":374,"y":1608,"width":75,"height":37},{"text":"선택적","x":468,"y":1608,"width":96,"height":36},{"text":"재전송과","x":583,"y":1607,"width":135,"height":37},{"text":"결합되었을","x":733,"y":1607,"width":166,"height":36},{"text":"경우(이미","x":915,"y":1607,"width":142,"height":38},{"text":"수신자가","x":1075,"y":1607,"width":137,"height":38},{"text":"선택적","x":1227,"y":1608,"width":97,"height":37},{"text":"확인응답","x":1342,"y":1609,"width":135,"height":36}]},{"text":"을 한 세그먼트의 재전송을 제외), TCP는 원래의 SR 프로토콜과 많이 유사하다. 그래","words":[{"text":"을","x":177,"y":1666,"width":33,"height":37},{"text":"한","x":223,"y":1667,"width":33,"height":37},{"text":"세그먼트의","x":269,"y":1669,"width":165,"height":37},{"text":"재전송을","x":451,"y":1668,"width":135,"height":37},{"text":"제외),","x":599,"y":1667,"width":87,"height":39},{"text":"TCP는","x":699,"y":1669,"width":105,"height":34},{"text":"원래의","x":818,"y":1666,"width":95,"height":38},{"text":"SR","x":930,"y":1671,"width":46,"height":29},{"text":"프로토콜과","x":990,"y":1668,"width":170,"height":37},{"text":"많이","x":1172,"y":1668,"width":63,"height":38},{"text":"유사하다.","x":1252,"y":1669,"width":142,"height":37},{"text":"그래","x":1409,"y":1669,"width":63,"height":36}]},{"text":"서 TCP의 오류 부구 메커니즘은 GBN과 SR 프로토콜의 혼합으로 분류하는 것이 적","words":[{"text":"서","x":179,"y":1728,"width":27,"height":37},{"text":"TCP의","x":223,"y":1729,"width":102,"height":37},{"text":"오류","x":343,"y":1731,"width":67,"height":35},{"text":"부구","x":424,"y":1730,"width":69,"height":36},{"text":"메커니즘은","x":508,"y":1728,"width":168,"height":37},{"text":"GBN과","x":689,"y":1728,"width":115,"height":36},{"text":"SR","x":818,"y":1732,"width":46,"height":28},{"text":"프로토콜의","x":879,"y":1728,"width":164,"height":37},{"text":"혼합으로","x":1061,"y":1729,"width":136,"height":36},{"text":"분류